WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.329 --> 00:00:14.670
Hey youtubers it’s charlie and this week
on arrow what happens in russia stays in russia.

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:19.289
Amanda Waller debuted and Deadshot returned
giving us a teaser of secret six things to

00:00:19.289 --> 00:00:20.289
come.

00:00:20.289 --> 00:00:22.500
We also learned HIVE is going to be a big
bad this season.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.760
So let’s talk about our favorite moments
and the big DC Universe references and then

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.760
I’ll do my review.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.340
So first, Amanda Waller is part of the show
now.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:35.220
On the show she leads ARGUS, which is like
the DC Universes version of SHIELD.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.880
Instead of helping the avengers they help
the Justice League.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:43.520
Amanda Waller has always been a frenemy to
superheroes in past incarnations like on smallville

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:44.520
and in the comics.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.660
So I think if she ends up helping Team Arrow
this season it will only be in the most dire

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:49.660
of circumstances.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.050
We will see the suicide squad though, which
is where deadshot comes in.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:55.280
Diggle was forced to rescue him during his
mission, and now he’s free.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:59.260
Amanda Waller will probably end up arresting
him in a future episode and forcing him to

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:02.200
work with Bronze Tiger and the other members
of the squad.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.780
Covering the rest of the Russian bases.

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.890
Oliver and Isobel totally hook up.

00:01:05.890 --> 00:01:13.600
They’re on good terms when the episode ends,
so they might continue to hook up a little

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:23.800
this season, but they’re not going to be
a couple.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:24.800
Much to the chagrin of Felicity.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.010
I seriously felt bad for her.

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:30.640
You could just see her burning a hole through
oliver’s skull with superman heat vision

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:31.640
eyes.

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:38.920
I liked her line that oliver deserved to be
with someone he cared about.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.060
Meaning her basically.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:44.440
At comic con, Emily Bett Rickards and Stephen
Amell basically said that Felicity and Oliver

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:49.310
wouldn’t be a couple this season and wouldn’t
really hook up, but that they would become

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:51.990
so close they’d feel like a married couple.

00:01:51.990 --> 00:02:00.370
So does oliver hooking up with all these other
women mean he’s cheating on her.

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:03.970
You can write yes or no in the comments.

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:07.890
The other main story was Doctor Ivo back on
the boat.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:16.819
They’re basically trying to find world war
II japanese super soldiers to try and replicate

00:02:16.819 --> 00:02:18.280
some of their serum.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.370
And kill slade.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:26.170
You see him with this epic burn on half his
face explains how he gets to the one eyed

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.170
deathstroke.

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:30.840
But here’s where the DC Universe references
get really cool, so HIVE was mentioned.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:34.320
In the comics it stands for Holistic Integration
For Viral Equality.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.870
They’re basically like the opposite of ARGUS
and they fight against superheroes.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:44.610
So they will probably be our big bad and end
up having something to do with the Brother

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:46.280
Blood storyline.

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:50.650
The DC references go even deeper with the
characters on Arrow though.

00:02:50.650 --> 00:03:01.730
So HIVE was started by Slade Wilson’s ex-wife,
slade that had half his face burned on the

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:02.910
island and became deathstroke.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.790
Talia Al Ghul is also a member of HIVE.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:08.160
And remember my Summer Glau Talia Al Ghul
theory.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:09.410
I so got a Dark Knight rises vibe from her
and oliver’s hookup.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:13.680
Well what if Isabel Rochev or Talia Al Ghul
or whoever she really is is connected to HIVE.

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:17.780
And HIVE was trying to gain control of Queen
Consolidated to help them takeover Starling

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:18.780
City.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:22.720
Now that we’re several episodes in we have
enough dots to start connect as the larger

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.720
plot of season 2 unfolds.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.720
There’s still a lot we don’t know about
HIVE, Brother Blood and Summer Glau yet.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:25.720
But I bet they’re all connected.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.010
Let me know what your theory is in the comments
below.

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:31.220
Next week Count Vertigo returns to the show.

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:32.920
Be sure to subscribe to get my video.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:33.920
But what did I think of the episode.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.290
This was one of the best episode this season.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.010
I give it a B plus.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:42.230
The Russian field trip was a nice change of
pace visually and it gave us some good character

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.230
development for Summer glau’s character
and added some complexity to Oliver’s relationship

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:44.230
with felicity.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:45.230
We also learned what the secret of those misshapen
skeletons were on the island.

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:46.380
Super soldiers from world war 2.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.430
Like the japanese versions of Captain America.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:49.690
The deadshot plot was great and gave his character
a place to go, now he’s more than just a

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:50.690
freak of the week.

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:51.920
Kind of teasing us with the amanda waller
suicide squad story that will come later this

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:52.920
season.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.360
One of the reasons I love arrow so much is
that it isn’t afraid to use characters and

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.050
events from the DC Universe en masse.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.090
Agents of SHIELD on the other hand has been
kind of stingy with it’s integration with

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:01.090
the Marvel Universe.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.709
But let me know what your favorite moments/favorite
hookups were.

00:04:04.709 --> 00:04:07.760
What happens on emergency awesome stays on
emergency awesome.

